Minimum expected count 16.63; **0 of 9 cells < 5** (0 < 1) → Pearson χ² validity satisfied.

## Pearson residuals (largest contributions)
| cell | obs | exp | resid | share of χ² |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Hypo × Down | 119 | 16.63 | **+25.11** | 69.9% |
| Hyper × Up | 106 | 29.22 | **+14.20** | 22.4% |
| no sig × Down | 284 | 376.25 | −4.76 | 2.5% |
| Hypo × no-DEGs | 383 | 472.42 | −4.11 | 1.9% |

Direction-concordant signal: hypermethylation↔up-regulation, hypomethylation↔down-regulation
(cross-discordant cells Hyper × Down and Hypo × Up are depleted, −2.15 and −2.77).

